Derived from earthShadow.tif in CosmoScout VR
(https://github.com/cosmoscout/cosmoscout-vr/blob/main/resources/textures/earthShadow.tif),
which was produced by the tool described in:
  Schneegans, Gilg, Ahlers, Zachmann, Gerndt.
  "Physically Based Real-Time Rendering of Eclipses."
  Computer Graphics Forum 44(2), 2025. https://doi.org/10.1111/cgf.70017

Repackaged from 256x256 float32 linear TIFF to 2048x2048 8-bit sRGB-encoded
lossless WebP. Source data is unmodified except for the bicubic upsample.
